 "messages": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 0e 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 14 00}I know this is sudden, but\nhere, {01 00 00 05 00}take this!\n{07 00 00}I don't know why, but{01 00 00 05 00}\nsuddenly, I just wanted to\nget you a present.\n{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Usually, I'm the one getting\npresents{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 1b 00}{01 00 00 05 00}It's weird being\non the other side.",
   "et": "{07 0e 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 0c 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 14 00}Ma tean, et see on äkiline,\naga säh, {01 00 00 05 00}võta see!\n{07 00 00}Ma ei tea, miks, aga{01 00 00 05 00}\näkki lihtsalt tahtsin\nsulle kingitust teha.\n{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Tavaliselt saan mina\nkingitusi{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 1b 00}{01 00 00 05 00}On imelik olla\nteisel pool."
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Oh,{01 00 00 0a 00} it's you, {04 1f 00}!\n\n\n{07 0e 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 0c 00}{01 01 00}{07 14 00}I know this is sudden,{01 00 00 0a 00}\nbut I want to give you this\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}!\n{07 19 00}No, no, there's no need{01 00 00 0a 00}\nto say anything.{01 00 00 14 00} I know\nyou're overcome.",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Oi,{01 00 00 0a 00} see oled sina, {04 1f 00}!\n\n\n{07 0e 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 0c 00}{01 01 00}{07 14 00}Tean, et see on äkiline,{01 00 00 0a 00}\naga ma tahan sulle anda\nselle {0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}!\n{07 19 00}Ei, ei, pole vaja{01 00 00 0a 00}\nmidagi öelda.{01 00 00 14 00} Ma tean,\net sa oled liigutatud."
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Do you have\n{04 1a 00}?{01 00 00 0a 00} No?\n\n{07 19 00}Well, please allow me to fill\nthat need. No thanks\nnecessary.\n{07 15 00}I mean it!{01 00 00 14 00}\nDon't say a word, and just\ntake it, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 0b 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Kas sul on\n{04 1a 00}?{01 00 00 0a 00} Ei?\n\n{07 19 00}Noh, luba mul see vajadus\ntäita. Tänu pole\nvaja.\n{07 15 00}Ma mõtlen seda!{01 00 00 14 00}\nÄra ütle sõnagi, lihtsalt\nvõta see, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!"
  }
 ]
